# Print-resolution originals. These are the masters the web assets in
# public/Assets are derived from — the Urban Nest brochure alone is 414 MB,
# well past GitHub's 100 MB file limit, and the area comparison is internal
# competitor analysis that must never reach a public directory.
# Keep them in cloud storage; regenerate web copies rather than committing.
source-assets/

# Design-system source bundles (multi-MB, embedded fonts and images)
Sumeet Design System.html
Sumeet Group Website UI With Images.html

# Unreferenced image exports pulled out of public/ during the WebP pass:
# duplicate renders, screenshots and brochure page dumps that nothing links
# to. Every one of them is already in this repo's history at its old path
# under public/Assets, so ignoring them here loses nothing and keeps ~8 MB
# of dead weight out of the deploy and out of future clones.
assets-unused/
